Drop local packages here before build-iso.sh (gitignored binaries).
build-iso.sh stages these automatically when present:

  appsynergy-linux-*.pkg.tar.zst          (the kernel, both variants)
  appsynergy-linux-headers-*.pkg.tar.zst
  appsynergy-branding-*.pkg.tar.zst       (required offline after pacstrap)
  appsynergy-branding-desktop-*.pkg.tar.zst
  appsynergy-wallpapers-*.pkg.tar.zst
  appsynergy-mirrorlist-*.pkg.tar.zst
  appsynergy-keyring-*.pkg.tar.zst
  appsynergy-ca-certificates-*.pkg.tar.zst
  brave-bin-*.pkg.tar.zst
  thorium-browser-bin-*.pkg.tar.zst       (optional)

Retired linux-appsynergy-* and linux-cachyos-igpu-* packages are pruned at build.

Published also at:
  https://github.com/Appsynergy-io/appsynergy-linux/releases/download/repo-x86_64
